tengine/godot/pull/119445.patch","merged_at":"2026-05-15T20:49:45Z"},"body":"Addresses part of #119269\r\n\r\n`sfinae-incomplete` was introduced in GCC 16, which is meant to catch definitions of types that failed to be complete in an SFINAE context.\r\n\r\nAt the moment, this happens with the `STATIC_ASSERT_INCOMPLETE_TYPE()` macro followed by completing that type, which is a context we ***do*** want the type to be incomplete, meaning the warning is a false positive.\r\n\r\n**Note**: it has to be done with `env.AppendUnique` instead of adding to `common_warnings` as `cc1` will spam warnings otherwise.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119445/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119445/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}